IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `types`
IMPORT `chapter-2-explanations`
IMPORT `chapter-4-exceptions`

§ `Chapter 17 -- Personal information and fraud by representation`

-- Penal Code 1871 ss 416A, 424A, 424B.
-- Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.

§§ `Section 416A -- Illegally obtained personal information`

-- (1)(a) obtain or retain, knowing or having reason to believe obtained without consent.
-- Not an offence under (1)(a) if purpose is other than use in an offence or supply for that use.
-- (1)(b) supply, offer, transmit or make available.
-- Not an offence under (1)(b) if purpose is other than use in an offence AND the person
-- did not know or have reason to believe it will be or is likely to be so used.
-- Mere network access / routing is not transmitting or making available.

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 416A(1)(a)"
GIVEN p IS A `Personal Information Dealing`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 416A obtain or retain limb` IF
        p's `the information is personal information about an individual`
    AND p's `the actor knows or has reason to believe it was obtained without that individual consent`
    AND p's `obtains or retains the personal information`
    AND (   p's `purpose is use in committing or facilitating an offence`
         OR p's `purpose is supply for use in committing or facilitating an offence`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 416A(1)(b)"
GIVEN p IS A `Personal Information Dealing`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 416A supply limb` IF
        p's `the information is personal information about an individual`
    AND p's `the actor knows or has reason to believe it was obtained without that individual consent`
    AND p's `supplies offers transmits or makes available the personal information`
    AND NOT p's `merely provides or operates network access or routing facilities`
    AND NOT (    NOT p's `purpose is supply for use in committing or facilitating an offence`
             AND NOT p's `knows or has reason to believe it will be or is likely to be used to commit or facilitate an offence`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 416A"
@export Decide whether the dealing in personal information is an offence under Penal Code 1871 section 416A
GIVEN p IS A `Personal Information Dealing` @desc Personal information is any information, whether true or not, of a type commonly used to identify an individual (name, NRIC, passport, password, card number, biometric data, signature, user authentication code, address, date of birth). Set knowledge that it was obtained without consent, whether the actor obtains/retains or supplies/transmits, and the purpose flags.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes illegally obtained personal information offence` IF
        `section 416A obtain or retain limb` p
    OR  `section 416A supply limb` p

§§ `Section 424A -- Fraud not connected with contracts for goods or services`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 424A(5)"
GIVEN fr IS A `Fraud Conduct`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is a false representation` IF
        fr's `makes a false representation`
    AND fr's `the representation is untrue or misleading`
    AND fr's `the actor knows it is or might be untrue or misleading`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 424A(1)"
GIVEN fr IS A `Fraud Conduct`
      f IS A Fault
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is a 424A or 424B physical element` IF
        `the act is done dishonestly` f
    OR  `the act is done fraudulently` f

GIVEN fr IS A `Fraud Conduct`
      f IS A Fault
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `there is a 424 physical limb` IF
        `there is a 424A or 424B physical element` fr f
    AND (   `there is a false representation` fr
         OR fr's `fails to disclose information which the actor is under a legal duty to disclose`
         OR fr's `abuses a position expected to safeguard the financial interests of another`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 424A"
@export Decide whether the conduct is fraud under Penal Code 1871 section 424A (not connected with a goods or services contract)
GIVEN fr IS A `Fraud Conduct` @desc False representation, failure to disclose under a legal duty, or abuse of a position expected to safeguard another financial interests. Materiality is irrelevant (s 424A(2)). This section does not apply where the conduct is directly connected with a written or oral contract for the supply of goods or services (s 424A(4)) -- those facts go to s 424B.
      f IS A Fault @desc The act must be done fraudulently or dishonestly.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes section 424A fraud` IF
        `there is a 424 physical limb` fr f
    AND NOT fr's `is directly connected with a written or oral contract for the supply of goods or services`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 424B"
@export Decide whether the conduct is fraud under Penal Code 1871 section 424B
GIVEN fr IS A `Fraud Conduct` @desc Same physical limbs as s 424A. s 424B does not apply to any act which would constitute an offence under s 424A.
      f IS A Fault @desc The act must be done fraudulently or dishonestly.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes section 424B fraud` IF
        `there is a 424 physical limb` fr f
    AND fr's `is directly connected with a written or oral contract for the supply of goods or services`

§§ `Proposed Act wrappers`

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes illegally obtained personal information offence` IF
        `constitutes illegally obtained personal information offence` (a's `personal information dealing`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes section 424A fraud` IF
        `constitutes section 424A fraud` (a's `fraud conduct`) (a's `fault`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes section 424B fraud` IF
        `constitutes section 424B fraud` (a's `fraud conduct`) (a's `fault`)
    AND NOT (`a general exception applies` a)

§§ `Illustrations`

`stolen NRIC retained for an offence` MEANS `Personal Information Dealing` WITH
    `the information is personal information about an individual` IS TRUE
    `the actor knows or has reason to believe it was obtained without that individual consent` IS TRUE
    `obtains or retains the personal information` IS TRUE
    `supplies offers transmits or makes available the personal information` IS FALSE
    `purpose is use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS TRUE
    `purpose is supply for use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe it will be or is likely to be used to commit or facilitate an offence` IS FALSE
    `merely provides or operates network access or routing facilities` IS FALSE

`NRIC retained to return to owner` MEANS `Personal Information Dealing` WITH
    `the information is personal information about an individual` IS TRUE
    `the actor knows or has reason to believe it was obtained without that individual consent` IS TRUE
    `obtains or retains the personal information` IS TRUE
    `supplies offers transmits or makes available the personal information` IS FALSE
    `purpose is use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS FALSE
    `purpose is supply for use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe it will be or is likely to be used to commit or facilitate an offence` IS FALSE
    `merely provides or operates network access or routing facilities` IS FALSE

`false representation not on a goods contract` MEANS `Fraud Conduct` WITH
    `makes a false representation` IS TRUE
    `fails to disclose information which the actor is under a legal duty to disclose` IS FALSE
    `abuses a position expected to safeguard the financial interests of another` IS FALSE
    `the representation is untrue or misleading` IS TRUE
    `the actor knows it is or might be untrue or misleading` IS TRUE
    `the representation is submitted to a system or device designed to receive communications` IS TRUE
    `is directly connected with a written or oral contract for the supply of goods or services` IS FALSE
    `the acts were material` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `constitutes illegally obtained personal information offence` `stolen NRIC retained for an offence`
#ASSERT NOT (`constitutes illegally obtained personal information offence` `NRIC retained to return to owner`)
#ASSERT `constitutes section 424A fraud` `false representation not on a goods contract` `s25 fraud`
#ASSERT NOT (`constitutes section 424B fraud` `false representation not on a goods contract` `s25 fraud`)

